Chapter: PathPhantomUncited

 The other half of it. This program uses path-filename and never cites
 the chapter that defines it.

 It used to type-check. The type environment bound path-filename as a
 builtin, so the checker vouched for the name, and the failure arrived at
 the very end of the build as CDX2040: an unresolved function offset. The
 compiler had promised a name it had no way to emit, and then complained
 about the consequence rather than the promise.

 It fails at name resolution now, where an unknown name belongs.

Section: Body
  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (path-filename "/src/main.codex")
  end
